'''Sweet''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by purchasing the Sweet Gamepass for 1,699 Robux or the [[Sweet Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Valentines Event 2026|2026 Valentine's Event]]. 

== Appearance ==
The knife has a dessert theme, with pink icing and sprinkles on the blade. There are also light pink hearts and light blue stars on the blade and handle, with a pink teddy bear head above the guard. The handle and edge of the blade are a pinkish-white color. There is pink frosting above the guard and on the pommel.

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly gun [[Treat]], creating the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Sweet Set|Sweet Set]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Sweet]].

